# ==============================================================================
# Database: L7 Multicast & Broadcast Signatures (mDNS / SSDP / WS-Discovery)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Regex Pattern | Protocol / Service Name | Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Matched against raw UDP payload broadcasts (ports 5353, 1900, 3702, 137).
#   2. Unlike other databases, this engine checks all rules and selects the 
#      highest score (cur_sc > best_l7_sc).
#
# Example:
#   _airplay\._tcp|Apple AirPlay Target|96|smart-speaker|Apple
#   _googlecast\._tcp|Google Cast Device|96|smart-tv|Google
# ==============================================================================
model=iphone|Apple iPhone (iOS)|98|smartphone|Apple
model=ipad|Apple iPad (iPadOS)|98|tablet-phone|Apple
model=appletv|Apple TV (tvOS)|98|smart-tv|Apple
model=audioaccessory.*mini|Apple HomePod mini|98|smart-speaker|Apple
model=audioaccessory|Apple HomePod (audioOS)|98|smart-speaker|Apple

